Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Add per-folder grouping policy and list sections

Separate time/name classification from view lifecycle. Add per-folder controls, metadata migration, live heading bindings, and list regressions. Remap display tests to test/display/ and adapt test constructors to create_view_with_slot for 51.1.
